@startuml
title SSD - UC-04 - Stop Session

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "FocusDesktop System" as System

Learner -> System : stopSession(sessionId)
System --> Learner : sessionCompleted(sessionId, actualSeconds, completedAt)
System --> Learner : sessionSummary(totalFocusSeconds, completedSessions, currentStreak)

note right of System
  This success flow records at least five minutes of
  actual work time. Paused and break time do not count.
end note

@enduml
